            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Memophant 3.2.0</h2>
<p>Folders to organize your project sidebar.</p>

<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Sidebar folders.</strong> Create folders between Pinned and Projects. Drag projects onto a folder or use the new "Move to" menu (replaces Pin to Top / Unpin). Rename inline, collapse any section, delete empty folders. Folders sync across your Macs with iCloud.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
